  "description": "SOBTOU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: (C21 H15 Cl13 O28 Pr4 Sb12 4-)n,n(C36 H24 Fe1 N6 2+),2n(C6 H8 N1 1+),2n(C6 H7 N1),3n(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr3 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr4 (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr3_2 (Pr) has 1 O neighbors; Pr4_2 (Pr) has 1 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.780-4.881 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 122.41-123.74°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C81H75N10O31Cl13FeSb12Pr4.",
